#: ../../src/idle.rst:5
msgid ":c:type:`uv_idle_t` --- Idle handle"
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_idle_t` —— Idle 句柄"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:7
msgid ""
"Idle handles will run the given callback once per loop iteration, right "
"before the :c:type:`uv_prepare_t` handles."
msgstr ""
"Idle 句柄会在每轮循环迭代中运行给定的回调一次，恰好在 :c:type:"
"`uv_prepare_t` 句柄之前。"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:11
msgid ""
"The notable difference with prepare handles is that when there are active"
" idle handles, the loop will perform a zero timeout poll instead of "
"blocking for i/o."
msgstr ""
"与 prepare 句柄的显著区别在于：当存在活动的 idle 句柄时，循环会执行一次"
"零超时的轮询，而不是阻塞等待 I/O。"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:15
msgid ""
"Despite the name, idle handles will get their callbacks called on every "
"loop iteration, not when the loop is actually \"idle\"."
msgstr ""
"尽管名字如此，idle 句柄的回调会在每轮循环迭代中都被调用，而不是在循环真"
"正“空转”时才被调用。"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:20
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:24
msgid "Idle handle type."
msgstr "Idle 句柄类型。"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:28
msgid "Type definition for callback passed to :c:func:`uv_idle_start`."
msgstr "传递给 :c:func:`uv_idle_start` 的回调的类型定义。"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:32
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:34
msgid "N/A"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:36
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:40
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:44
msgid "Initialize the handle. This function always succeeds."
msgstr "初始化句柄。此函数总是成功。"

#: ../../src/idle.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:46 ../../src/idle.rst:60
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:50
msgid ""
"Start the handle with the given callback. This function always succeeds, "
"except when `cb` is `NULL`."
msgstr "以给定的回调启动句柄。此函数总是成功，除非 `cb` 为 `NULL`。"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:53
msgid "0 on success, or `UV_EINVAL` when `cb == NULL`."
msgstr "成功时为 0，否则为 `UV_EINVAL` （`cb == NULL` 时）。"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:57
msgid ""
"Stop the handle, the callback will no longer be called. This function "
"always succeeds."
msgstr "停止该句柄，回调将不再被调用。此函数总是成功。"

#: ../../src/idle.rst:62
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"
